{"id":"4875a0c262fafe7c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-arithmetization-property.md","title":"Arithmetization Property","display":"df-arithmetization-property — Arithmetization Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-arithmetization-property","aliases":["92-df-arithmetization-property"],"display":"df-arithmetization-property — Arithmetization Property","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-expression]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]"],"source":"第 III 章 pp. 30–36；第 IV 章 pp. 53–54（PDF 47–53、70–71）","source_status":"本地 PR 性质，强度须另证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-arithmetization-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-arithmetization-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetization-property — Arithmetization Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 30–36；第 IV 章 pp. 53–54（PDF 47–53、70–71）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地 PR 性质，强度须另证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k\\)</span> (arity and syntactic relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive numerical-function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRArith}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{PRArith}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PRArith}_G(R)\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k\\land\n\\exists P\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^k}\\bigr)\\;\n\\forall(n_1,\\ldots,n_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Bigl(\nP(n_1,\\ldots,n_k)=1\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists(s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\\in R\\;\n(n_1,\\ldots,n_k)=(\\ulcorner s_1\\urcorner,\\ldots,\\ulcorner s_k\\urcorner)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PRArith}_G(R)\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k\\land\n\\exists P\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^k}\\bigr)\\;\n\\forall(n_1,\\ldots,n_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Bigl(\nP(n_1,\\ldots,n_k)=1\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists(s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\\in R\\;\n(n_1,\\ldots,n_k)=(\\ulcorner s_1\\urcorner,\\ldots,\\ulcorner s_k\\urcorner)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>算术化性质</li>\n<li>语法性质转化为算术关系</li>\n<li>例：&quot;公式编号&quot; → 算术谓词</li>\n<li>例：&quot;证明编号&quot; → 算术谓词</li>\n<li>关键：定义要求一个元数正确、取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 的 PR 特征函数，并在非法码上取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；并非任意语法关系都满足</li>\n<li>再配合 PR 关系在 PA 中的可表示性定理，才能把特定的证明关系变成 PA 内部公式</li>\n<li>算术化的成功是编码基础</li>\n<li>Gödel的核心贡献</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书 Arithmetic 表示在 L_E 中可表达，arithmetic 表示无指数可表达；二者与本地 PRArith 的“特征函数为 PR”定义不同。原书经过正 Σ 与 Σ₁ 合并得定理码集的 Σ₁ 性，详见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c056f7fa0375bc62\" href=\"?note=c056f7fa0375bc62\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization\">92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization</a>；不能把任意算术集视为 PR 集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-expression]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$ and $R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k$ (arity and syntactic relation, see [[92-df-expression]], [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$ and $R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k$ (arity and syntactic relation, see [[92-df-expression]], [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ (Gödel numbering, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive numerical-function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization","status":"resolved","id":"c056f7fa0375bc62","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书 Arithmetic 表示在 L_E 中可表达，arithmetic 表示无指数可表达；二者与本地 PRArith 的“特征函数为 PR”定义不同。原书经过正 Σ 与 Σ₁ 合并得定理码集的 Σ₁ 性，详见 [[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]]；不能把任意算术集视为 PR 集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRArith}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PRArith}_G(R)\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k\\land\n\\exists P\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^k}\\bigr)\\;\n\\forall(n_1,\\ldots,n_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Bigl(\nP(n_1,\\ldots,n_k)=1\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists(s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\\in R\\;\n(n_1,\\ldots,n_k)=(\\ulcorner s_1\\urcorner,\\ldots,\\ulcorner s_k\\urcorner)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":2146,"backlinks":[{"id":"c4da698d5dde6a6d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRArith}_G$ (arithmetization-property predicate, see [[92-df-arithmetization-property]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-property]]"}],"outgoing":["2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","c56ec2b54fc34fc6","d666a3e3ee6c8148","8bff810dd710385a","c056f7fa0375bc62"]}